WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
Two schools ask their pupils
how they get to school.

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.850
Each school draws a pie
chart to show the results.

3
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.710
Look at the walking slices.

4
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.170
They are exactly the same size.

5
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:14.990
So did the same number of
pupils walk to each school?

6
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.350
Can you tell just from the slices?

7
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.890
In this mission, you'll
read frequency tables.

8
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.590
You'll read bar charts and pictograms,

9
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.970
and check the key and the axes.

10
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.760
And you'll work out the angles
for the slices of a pie chart.

11
00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:32.790
Your mission: decide what two
matching pie charts can really

12
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:33.950
tell you.
